  fl5-a1 example.com -> 172.66.147.243 104.20.23.154
  fl5-b1 fl5-probe -> NXDOMAIN
  fl5-b1 example.com -> 172.66.147.243 104.20.23.154
  fl5-d1 fl5-probe -> NXDOMAIN
  fl5-d1 example.com -> 172.66.147.243 104.20.23.154
