## 3. helper releases: fl5_a falls straight back to mDNSResponder
-- ctl: <empty>
  fl5-a1 example.com -> 172.66.147.243 104.20.23.154
  fl5-a1 fl5-probe -> NXDOMAIN
-- :53 sockets
   udp6 *.53
   udp4 *.53
-- helper log (new lines)
   21:33:08 192.168.64.1: CLOSED (not requested)
